# tag-bars — шаги записи (что показывается — tag-bars.md)
# Его замечание 2026-10-05: два GIF — поведение (этот) и вид (tag-bars-look: толщина, расстояния).
# Нажатий нет: этап — заход в настройки и смена контрола, после выхода — заметка в новом виде.
title Tag Bars | A colored bar down each tree shows its status
open Tag bars.md
caret ## Garden project
stage Default look
say Default: no Bars, only the tags
pause 2600

stage Tag Bars
say Tag Bars → on, drawn by Status
settings Visual
set Tag Bars = on
set Which Field draws Bars = Status
say A Bar in the tag's color runs down each tree
pause 2800

stage Number of Bars
say Number of Bars → 3
settings Visual
set Number of Bars = 3
say The third level gets its own Bar
pause 2600

stage Hide the tag
say Show the Field’s tag → off
settings Visual
set Show the Field’s tag = off
set Hide the leftover marker = on
say The Bar speaks for the tag, the lonely || goes too
pause 2800

stage Not the whole tree
say Bars for the whole tree → off
settings Visual
set Bars for the whole tree = off
say Each Bar covers only its own line
pause 2800

stage Separate Bars
say Bars for the whole tree → on, Join Bars in a tree → off
settings Visual
set Bars for the whole tree = on
set Join Bars in a tree = off
say Parent and child Bars break apart
pause 2800
